            <note corresp="#d86-f4" n="4" xml:id="d86-f4-content">
                <p>CFEP 520/3, a memorandum from Joseph Dodge to the CFEP, dated April 1, summarized
                    CFEP 520/1 and CFEP 520/2 and offered for discussion a possible position for the
                    Council to take on the CSC cartel problem. (Department of State, E–CFEP Files:
                    Lot 61 D 282A, CFEP 520)</p>
